      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Express",
      "venue_abbr": "OE",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "equalizer",
        "DP-16QAM",
        "coherent optical transmission",
        "digital coherent receiver",
        "chromatic dispersion compensation",
        "fiber nonlinearity compensation"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.613485",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/794a015e-9a4e-44cc-91dd-5fb4aede3d12.html",
      "summary": "论文提出将基于FFE的2×2 MIMO与简化软输出最大似然序列估计（s-SMLSE）级联的均衡方案。FFE缓解带宽限制导致的符号间干扰，后级处理残余干扰并实现噪声白化；利用前级FFE计算的可靠LLR替换状态压缩产生的不确定LLR。作者通过100 Gbaud DP-16QAM信号在80 km标准单模光纤上的传输实验进行评估。摘要报告，相比传统多抽头MIMO与全状态SMLSE方案，该架构实现近乎相同的SD-FEC译码性能，总计算复杂度降低28.4%。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
